# The image is built from the repository root (deploy/Dockerfile): only the sources it copies are sent to Docker.
# Patterns with **/ match at any depth: a log or an .env inside a project folder stays out too.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/var
**/test-artifacts
**/*.log
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.*.local.json
.git
.github
.claude
.husky
.tools
.vscode
data
e2e
docs
!docs/ruleset.default.json
